From: NAOE Kenichi <ken@naoe.tokyo>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 03:11:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add shared codec for event-key signing links

Parses beid://event-key-sign links for two typed purposes (personhood
binding and claim), builds the exact message the event key signs, and
formats the callback fragment. Messages start with 0xFF, which no other
event-key-signed format can start with. Tests pin the golden vector
shared with mizar's contract and evaluator.
