From ab55662d0cc52d6e81a758a25dff3a34a70d3c27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NAOE Kenichi <ken@naoe.tokyo>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 06:29:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Let sensing say which event code signs an Event ID

