From 330a2867938a88595a94b72505e7699d2909b723 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NAOE Kenichi <ken@naoe.tokyo>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 06:29:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Add iOS handler and confirmation sheet for event-key
 signing links

beid://event-key-sign links are parsed by the shared codec, bound to a
recorded event, shown to the participant, and signed with the same
Barnard key owner that signs observations. The signature is recovered
and compared with the event key before it is returned, and it goes only
to the https callback compiled in for its purpose (placeholder .invalid
hosts until alcor and mizar are deployed). MetaMask links still pass
through untouched.
---
